#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:2
msgid "OpenMV Projects Tools"
msgstr "OpenMV Projects Tools"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The `OpenMV Projects Tools <https://github.com/openmv/openmv-"
"projects/tree/master/tools>`__ are a growing collection of desktop GUI "
"applications, each paired with a companion MicroPython script on the camera."
" The cam captures and streams sensor data; the desktop app receives it over "
"USB and provides the real-time visualisation, parameter tuning, or "
"calibration workflow that one specific use case needs."
msgstr ""
"`OpenMV Projects Tools <https://github.com/openmv/openmv-"
"projects/tree/master/tools>`__ adalah koleksi aplikasi GUI desktop yang "
"terus berkembang, masing-masing dipasangkan dengan skrip MicroPython "
"pendamping pada kamera. Kamera menangkap dan melakukan streaming data "
"sensor; aplikasi desktop menerimanya melalui USB dan menyediakan visualisasi"
" real-time, penyetelan parameter, atau alur kerja kalibrasi yang dibutuhkan "
"oleh satu kasus penggunaan tertentu."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"The CCM Tuning desktop GUI displaying live raw Bayer\n"
"output from an OpenMV N6 alongside a software replica\n"
"of the cam's ISP pipeline and an interactive\n"
"colour-correction matrix solver."
msgstr ""
"GUI desktop CCM Tuning menampilkan output Bayer mentah langsung dari OpenMV N6 bersama replika perangkat lunak\n"
"dari pipeline ISP kamera dan solver\n"
"matriks koreksi warna interaktif."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:13
msgid ".. image:: ccm-tuning.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: ccm-tuning.jpg"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"Each tool has its own subdirectory in the repository with the desktop "
"script, the companion cam-side script, a README covering install and usage, "
"and screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Setiap alat memiliki subdirektori sendiri di repositori dengan skrip "
"desktop, skrip pendamping di sisi kamera, README yang mencakup instalasi dan"
" penggunaan, serta tangkapan layar."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Tools currently in the repository include calibration utilities for "
"overlaying thermal or event-camera output on a colour frame, an interactive "
"ISP tuner for the OpenMV N6's colour pipeline (live debayer, white balance, "
"and colour-correction matrix), and a real-time visualiser for the Prophesee "
"GenX320 event sensor. New tools land in the repository as new sensors or "
"workflows call for one."
msgstr ""
"Alat yang saat ini ada di repositori mencakup utilitas kalibrasi untuk "
"mengoverlay output termal atau kamera event pada bingkai warna, penyetel ISP"
" interaktif untuk pipeline warna OpenMV N6 (debayer langsung, white balance,"
" dan matriks koreksi warna), serta visualisator real-time untuk sensor event"
" Prophesee GenX320. Alat baru masuk ke repositori seiring dengan adanya "
"sensor atau alur kerja baru yang membutuhkannya."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/projects-tools/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Every tool follows the same shape: a Python desktop application built with "
"`DearPyGui <https://github.com/hoffstadt/DearPyGui>`__, talking to the cam "
"through the openmv Python package over USB serial. Python 3.12 or newer is "
"required; macOS and Linux give the best USB throughput."
msgstr ""
"Setiap alat mengikuti bentuk yang sama: aplikasi desktop Python yang "
"dibangun dengan `DearPyGui <https://github.com/hoffstadt/DearPyGui>`__\\ , "
"berkomunikasi dengan kamera melalui paket Python openmv melalui USB serial. "
"Python 3.12 atau lebih baru diperlukan; macOS dan Linux memberikan "
"throughput USB terbaik."
